    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4512" root="ثفن" body-key="v">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُثَافِنٌ</span></b>  <i>Keeping to a person,</i> or <i>thing, constantly,
perseveringly,</i> or <i>assiduously:</i> (T, M:) or <i>keeping, cleaving,</i> or <i>clinging, to another:</i> as also
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُثْفِنٌ</span></b>  or ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُثِفِّنٌ</span></b>  (K, accord. to different copies,)
[or, probably, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِثْفَنٌ</span>, q. v.].

